statement error must appear in the GROUP BY clause or be used in an aggregate function
SELECT region, units FROM sales GROUP BY region

statement error aggregate functions are not allowed in WHERE
SELECT region FROM sales WHERE sum(units) > 1

statement error aggregate function calls cannot be nested
SELECT sum(count(*)) FROM sales

